1
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,199
Sorry.

2
00:00:28,079 --> 00:00:29,039
I dropped the candle.

3
00:00:43,759 --> 00:00:44,439
All set.

4
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:45,479
Let's go.

5
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,640
Why are there so many turns?

6
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:13,840
One, two, three, four.

7
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,439
Five.

8
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,200
Four.

9
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:22,640
Two leads to four.

10
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,680
I got it.

11
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:55,440
(Every morning should be exciting.)

12
00:02:55,440 --> 00:03:00,560
(Su Lin's Diary)
(Dawn should come with hope.)

13
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:28,200
=Ren Yu=

14
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,560
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

15
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,560
=Episode 12=

16
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,340
Ah!

17
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,839
Same model as Sun Hui's bike.

18
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:41,879
I checked the bike shop.

19
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,040
The clerk didn't remember

20
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:43,800
Sun Hui.

21
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:45,240
But they issued the receipt.

22
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,319
I checked her workplace

23
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,399
and around her home.

24
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,560
Nothing turned up.

25
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:51,199
A bike that big

26
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,480
can't just vanish down a sewer.

27
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,079
Expand the search.

28
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,519
Check used-bike dealers

29
00:06:58,519 --> 00:07:00,199
and repair shops for leads.

30
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,959
Why don't we go now?

31
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,360
Okay. Thanks.

32
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,120
Let's go.

33
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,319
Let's check ahead.

34
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:09,720
What's up there?

35
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,360
Noodle place on the corner.

36
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:13,839
We're on a case, and you want food?

37
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,519
I'm hungry.

38
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,319
Come on.

39
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:35,079
Who let you take bottles here?

40
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:38,800
That's my bag.

41
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,079
Those are my bottles.

42
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:41,560
Mine!

43
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:45,720
Get lost!

44
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,480
What'll we get?

45
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:51,120
What?

46
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,600
Two baskets of buns.

47
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,759
Three pork noodles.

48
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:56,559
Coming up.

49
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,399
Captain Wang.

50
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,519
Quite a feast.

51
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,200
Who's this?

52
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,120
None of your business. Eat.

53
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,039
Captain Wang.

54
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,240
Let's talk first.

55
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,919
I don't know what's up.

56
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,559
- Can't eat.
- You eating or not?

57
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,120
I am.

58
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,399
Good.

59
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,759
(Receipt Stub)
FOREVER women's bicycle.

60
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:29,960
Can you find it?

61
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:32,320
You know

62
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,440
how popular FOREVER bikes are.

63
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,240
It's tough. Really tough.

64
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:38,399
Find it fast.

65
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,679
It's life or death.

66
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:42,080
Man, I have a business to run.

67
00:10:42,519 --> 00:10:43,639
Fine. Then stop eating.

68
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,000
Go.

69
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,000
Wait!

70
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:51,200
Fine.

71
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,240
I'll find that bike no matter what.

72
00:10:53,519 --> 00:10:54,159
Thanks, man.

73
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,519
Here, eat up.

74
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,399
Where'd you get this milk?

75
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:58,840
Did you steal it?

76
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,519
I saw you sneaking around.

77
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,360
Did you steal it?

78
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:02,519
I didn't steal anything.

79
00:11:02,759 --> 00:11:03,840
I found it.

80
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,559
Found it?

81
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:07,120
Stealing at your age?

82
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,159
Shame on you.

83
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:10,000
Come to the station.

84
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:11,080
She's a thief.

85
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,960
Let go!

86
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,039
- Move.
- Let go!

87
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,080
What's going on?

88
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:19,919
Officer!

89
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:21,399
A thief! She stole from me!

90
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,639
What'd you lose?

91
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:49,519
A bottle of milk.

92
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:51,320
She's just a kid.

93
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:52,440
Just be more careful.

94
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,799
What happened?

95
00:12:08,879 --> 00:12:10,000
Nothing.

96
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,440
Just a misunderstanding.

97
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,399
Eat before the noodles get soggy.

98
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,279
They'll be ruined.

99
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,919
(Who'd take a kid like her?)

100
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,559
(Look. She's a thief.)

101
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,519
(Isn't dawn supposed to)

102
00:13:03,519 --> 00:13:05,000
(bring hope with it?)

103
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:08,720
(Why do mornings in my little town)

104
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:11,240
(always feel so overcast?)

105
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:16,559
(Before dawn can give us strength,)

106
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,759
(it's smothered beneath dark clouds.)

107
00:13:20,159 --> 00:13:22,080
What pictures do you like?

108
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,120
How about this one?

109
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,320
Cute, huh?

110
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,600
What else do you want?

111
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,279
A bunny.

112
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,559
A bunny?

113
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,200
Mommy will buy one later.

114
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,159
We'll take it home to eat, okay?

115
00:13:34,159 --> 00:13:35,159
Mm-hmm.

116
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:37,559
Your dance class today,

117
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,600
your teacher said

118
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,440
you did a great job.

119
00:13:41,919 --> 00:13:43,440
Want to go again next time?

120
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,440
Mm-hmm.

121
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,080
Finish up.

122
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,519
We're going to Grandma's after.

123
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:58,000
I think I've seen it there.

124
00:13:58,519 --> 00:13:59,639
That intersection ahead?

125
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:04,240
They're police.

126
00:14:07,039 --> 00:14:10,440
If I walk over and tell them

127
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,519
I'm Su Lin,

128
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:15,360
I attend
Chaobei Vocational High School.

129
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,519
they'll take me home.

130
00:14:34,399 --> 00:14:35,080
If...

131
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:39,320
If the police take me home,

132
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:43,759
my parents can't do anything about it.

133
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:47,639
Maybe

134
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,240
I could stay.

135
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,519
No one's called.

136
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,919
I checked. Nothing.

137
00:15:25,159 --> 00:15:27,320
Could Mr. Gu have gotten it wrong?

138
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,600
If only it were Lin.

139
00:15:39,639 --> 00:15:40,559
And this one

140
00:15:40,879 --> 00:15:42,159
was drafted by Attorney Shi.

141
00:15:42,159 --> 00:15:43,559
A custody modification agreement.

142
00:15:43,919 --> 00:15:44,840
Read it carefully.

143
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:47,639
If there's anything you don't like,

144
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:48,679
we can discuss it.

145
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:49,919
No.

146
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,320
No discussion.

147
00:15:52,279 --> 00:15:52,919
I won't agree.

148
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,759
You haven't even read it.

149
00:15:56,679 --> 00:15:57,840
It's simple.

150
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:58,919
This summer,

151
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:01,639
Ting will come to Beijing with me.

152
00:16:02,399 --> 00:16:03,360
While she's in Beijing,

153
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:04,759
I'll cover her expenses,

154
00:16:04,799 --> 00:16:07,399
including tuition.

155
00:16:07,799 --> 00:16:08,879
After college,

156
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,639
if she wants to keep studying,

157
00:16:10,879 --> 00:16:12,240
I'll pay for that too.

158
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:13,600
No.

159
00:16:13,919 --> 00:16:14,440
Jiang Yushu.

160
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:15,960
If that's your answer,

161
00:16:16,879 --> 00:16:17,759
then we're done.

162
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,519
See you in court.

163
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,679
Attorney Shi.

164
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:21,720
You tell her.

165
00:16:22,519 --> 00:16:23,320
Ms. Jiang.

166
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:24,360
I'm Shi.

167
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:25,960
My card.

168
00:16:29,519 --> 00:16:30,919
(Shi Jintao)
He hired you.

169
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:32,879
Your job

170
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:34,840
is to talk me into this?

171
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:35,840
Not at all.

172
00:16:36,039 --> 00:16:37,440
I'm not here to convince you.

173
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,840
Honestly, if you go to court,

174
00:16:39,879 --> 00:16:40,840
I make more money.

175
00:16:41,559 --> 00:16:42,559
So you're saying

176
00:16:43,639 --> 00:16:45,480
I'd definitely lose in court?

177
00:16:45,919 --> 00:16:47,840
One thing works against you.

178
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:50,240
Custody decisions

179
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,519
depend on each parent's

180
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:53,879
means and ability to provide.

181
00:16:54,399 --> 00:16:55,440
With her father,

182
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,159
she'll have more options

183
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,039
than she will with you.

184
00:17:00,279 --> 00:17:01,360
How much more?

185
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,039
It's simple.

186
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:06,519
Your daughter has a wall to climb.

187
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:09,039
She could be given a ladder.

188
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,759
But all you can give her is a rope.

189
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,200
Think carefully

190
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,880
about how she'll feel someday.

191
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:39,080
(Custody Modification Agreement)

192
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,559
Jiang Yushu.

193
00:17:47,119 --> 00:17:49,000
Stop holding your daughter back.

194
00:17:49,359 --> 00:17:51,359
Ting has a bright future.

195
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:52,920
You really want her to

196
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,240
stay stuck in this little town

197
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:55,920
and go nowhere, just like you?

198
00:17:56,559 --> 00:17:58,000
Like me?

199
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,039
I don't know what she'll become.

200
00:18:01,599 --> 00:18:02,480
But I do know

201
00:18:02,799 --> 00:18:03,960
she won't turn out like you.

202
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,680
Vile and shameless.

203
00:18:07,519 --> 00:18:08,319
I'm not arguing.

204
00:18:08,799 --> 00:18:09,440
Jiang Yushu.

205
00:18:09,799 --> 00:18:10,680
Be clear.

206
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:14,319
Everything I've done is for Ting.

207
00:18:14,759 --> 00:18:16,279
Search your conscience.

208
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,640
Think about it.

209
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,640
You keep saying it's all for Ting.

210
00:18:20,559 --> 00:18:21,960
When you chose to divorce me,

211
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,480
did you think of Ting?

212
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,920
You didn't call for four years.

213
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:26,799
Did you think of Ting?

214
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:28,559
Now you're all alone

215
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:29,480
and have no one,

216
00:18:29,559 --> 00:18:31,160
so you want custody of her?

217
00:18:32,039 --> 00:18:33,920
You follow Ting around every day,

218
00:18:34,319 --> 00:18:35,480
drive her to school,

219
00:18:35,559 --> 00:18:36,599
bring her gifts,

220
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,799
and even made me

221
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:39,039
watch your wife's affair

222
00:18:39,039 --> 00:18:39,880
and all that mess.

223
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:40,759
Why?

224
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:41,880
Was that for Ting?

225
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,279
It was all for you.

226
00:18:44,039 --> 00:18:45,839
If you really want what's best for her,

227
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:48,039
leave us alone.

228
00:18:48,119 --> 00:18:49,440
We're doing fine.

229
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,480
Listen, Sun Weiming.

230
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:52,599
Ting

231
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:54,960
can't take after you.

232
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:57,359
She needs to grow up decent.

233
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,080
Jiang Yushu.

234
00:18:58,081 --> 00:18:58,720
What?

235
00:18:59,039 --> 00:19:00,440
I'm not signing this.

236
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:09,960
Excuse me.

237
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:11,960
Check.

238
00:19:12,519 --> 00:19:13,400
Sure. One moment.

239
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,319
Sir.

240
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,319
You're shortchanging me.

241
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:30,160
That's it.

242
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:31,720
Take it or not.

243
00:20:37,359 --> 00:20:39,039
Wait, that cardboard isn't-

244
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:42,839
Xiao...

245
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:43,960
Take it or get out!

246
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:50,440
Xiaolan! Xiaolan!

247
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:52,920
Xiaolan!

248
00:20:54,119 --> 00:20:57,359
Xiaolan!

249
00:20:57,759 --> 00:20:58,480
Xiaolan!

250
00:20:59,119 --> 00:21:01,880
Xiaolan!

251
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,920
Yours?

252
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:05,960
Xiaolan!

253
00:21:06,599 --> 00:21:07,319
Xiaolan!

254
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:10,680
Xiaolan!

255
00:21:11,039 --> 00:21:11,799
Xiaolan!

256
00:21:12,119 --> 00:21:14,960
Xiaolan!

257
00:21:15,359 --> 00:21:18,119
Xiaolan!

258
00:21:18,519 --> 00:21:19,680
If anything, it's more.

259
00:21:19,759 --> 00:21:21,599
Xiaolan!

260
00:21:22,359 --> 00:21:26,400
Xiaolan!

261
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:31,440
Xiaolan!

262
00:21:32,519 --> 00:21:33,460
Xiaolan!

263
00:21:34,519 --> 00:21:35,279
Xiaolan!

264
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:37,079
Xiaolan!

265
00:21:39,079 --> 00:21:39,759
Xiaolan!

266
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:56,079
Look! Look at this!

267
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,759
Look!

268
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,440
I...

269
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:00,000
You're gonna let this thing

270
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,440
crawl around me all day?

271
00:22:01,599 --> 00:22:02,039
Mr. Ma.

272
00:22:02,079 --> 00:22:04,079
We had pest control last Monday.

273
00:22:04,119 --> 00:22:05,240
Then have them come again.

274
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,279
And again if you have to.

275
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,559
Till they're all gone.

276
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,680
Yes. I'll get someone tomorrow.

277
00:22:09,759 --> 00:22:11,200
Should I move out while you do it?

278
00:22:11,559 --> 00:22:12,079
Sorry, sir.

279
00:22:12,079 --> 00:22:13,000
I'll go right now.

280
00:22:18,359 --> 00:22:18,880
Hey.

281
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,000
I saw that woman from the Su family

282
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:21,920
at the telecom office,

283
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,279
getting her recent call records.

284
00:22:38,519 --> 00:22:39,640
Not again!

285
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:40,400
I...

286
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:42,799
Last period,

287
00:22:42,799 --> 00:22:43,880
what was that new teacher

288
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,960
even talking about?

289
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:47,160
Wow, you actually listened.

290
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,640
Only because he's cute.

291
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:49,799
Or I wouldn't bother.

292
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:55,160
Want barbecue?

293
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,039
Where?

294
00:22:58,759 --> 00:22:59,359
Sure.

295
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:01,200
That place.

296
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,000
There?

297
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,759
Ermingzi BBQ.

